    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "In SQL, the CASE statement allows us to perform different actions based on specific conditions."
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "For example, to categorize customers, you can create a new column, purchase_group, that labels customers as 'Target Customer' if their purchase amount falls between 2000 and 4999."
